From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MediaServer Yocto <mediaserver@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 12:20:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Disable Cargo strip for Yocto packaging

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [embedded build system handles stripping]

Let Yocto perform binary stripping during packaging so package QA and debug
symbol handling remain under the control of the build system.

---
 Cargo.toml | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Cargo.toml b/Cargo.toml
index 5f8ac8f..d0b0e3e 100644
--- a/Cargo.toml
+++ b/Cargo.toml
@@ -137,1 +137,0 @@
-strip = true

